<title>USA: TVX Gold stake cut by Quebec agency.</title>
<headline>TVX Gold stake cut by Quebec agency.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de depot et placement du Quebec said Tuesday it cut its stake in TVX Gold Inc to 7,996,953 common shares or 5.02 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the investment agency said its latest transactions include a net 2,273,447 shares at prices ranging from C$7.78 to C$9.90 per share.</p>
<p>The shares were either sold or purchased for investment purposes, the agency said.</p>
<p>TVX, based in Toronto, is a precious metals producer with interests in producing gold mines located in North and South America.</p>
</text>
